config BR2_PACKAGE_FPLINUX_CPUCLOCK
	bool "fplinux-cpuclock"
	help
	  Measure the CPU clock on the phone by timing a chain of
	  dependent integer additions, which retire at one per cycle
	  on this core. It reads no register and trusts neither the
	  device tree nor the vendor firmware, so it can be used to
	  check a clock frequency that was only ever asserted.
